{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No missions or cutscenes. This is a game about <strong>exploration</strong> and <strong>experimentation</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the Animals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you see an animal out of place or in distress, don't just stand there. Figure out what they need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clean the Beach</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Litter is not cool. Gather up any garbage you see and put it where it belongs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power the Machines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find machines around the island, but it's been a long time since they were serviced.<br><br>Batteries can be bought from vending machines, but you'll have to tidy up a bit first. If the machine still doesn't work, try shouting at it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it's not all work. Take your time and mess around. There are no adults here to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're ready, find a way to reach the next island. Unfortunately this young penguin is not a strong swimmer, so we have to get creative.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4096190?t=1762193899","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4096190?t=1762193899","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096190/4418749e53f227897efcfbe4547d7a969545f725/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762193899","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096190/4418749e53f227897efcfbe4547d7a969545f725/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762193899","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No missions or cutscenes. This is a game about <strong>exploration</strong> and <strong>experimentation</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Save the Animals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you see an animal out of place or in distress, don't just stand there. Figure out what they need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clean the Beach</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Litter is not cool. Gather up any garbage you see and put it where it belongs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power the Machines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find machines around the island, but it's been a long time since they were serviced.<br><br>Batteries can be bought from vending machines, but you'll have to tidy up a bit first. If the machine still doesn't work, try shouting at it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it's not all work. Take your time and mess around. There are no adults here to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're ready, find a way to reach the next island. Unfortunately this young penguin is not a strong swimmer, so we have to get creative.</p>","developers":["Lesser Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2906320","name":"Whelm"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4096190/948adf365e60ae59f15bb858d82eaec1b349c5bd/header.jpg?t=1762193899","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4096190/1954005901/f669102928f2543766a6a8f5657abc34a058f52a/1761424122/dash_av1.mpd?t=176164625